From: vps-ssh-launcher maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] Add explicit selected-account mode without automatic fallback

Source: https://github.com/mmqz/cpa-multi-plugins/tree/v0.8.84
Source tarball SHA256: 403fa287169be84ba9a2497e449ed8f0f800efca15aa52a108049ec197834413
Consumer: manual WorkBuddy plugin build on CPA v8.0.43; requires host Reject ABI.
Retire when upstream provides equivalent selection and host-rejection behavior.
Adapted 2026-10-26 from workbuddy-v0.8.68-selected-account.patch for v0.8.84:
only the main.go config-list hunk context changed (upstream inserted the
account_max_concurrent entry after stream_head_timeout); semantics identical.

